      "value": "This is a horrible idea, have the devs been to a public instance in the past years? Especially ones like black cat, it is full of trolls and everything. Adults already power trip in their group instances, what do you think a 14 year old will do with the power to kick or force mute? \n\nAlso the entire point of publics is that there is no moderation. If you want moderation go to a group public, don't bring that stuff into public worlds that will just ruin it.",
